## Secret and identity handling

- Generated files contain environment-variable names and secret references only.
- Credential values must remain in the approved secret or workload-identity system.
- External payloads, retrieved documents, webhook bodies, and connector responses are untrusted.
- Authorization is enforced server-side at object, property, function, tenant, and provider-connection boundaries.

## Supply-chain gate

Record the exact version or commit, license, source URL, review result, SBOM entry, and retained
notice before adapting third-party code. A catalog entry is research evidence, not approval to
vendor code.
